            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;">📍 Larkspur, Marin County</p>
            <div style="background: #22c55e; color: #fff; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              🟢 100% CLEAR (4.84' margin)
            </div>
            <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 12px; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                <td style="padding: 3px 0; color: #475569;"><b>👑 Road Crown / Crest:</b></td>
                <td style="padding: 3px 0; text-align: right; font-family: monospace;">7.42' NAVD88 (7.51' MLLW)</td>
              </tr>
