                <td style="padding: 3px 0; text-align: right; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #0284c7;">2.58' NAVD88 (2.67' MLLW)</td>
              </tr>
            </table>
            <p style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Concave road sag on Larkspur Plaza Dr near Heather Way. Drains 1-4 surcharge at 7.28' NAVD88; road crown overhauls at 7.42' NAVD88.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11px;"><a href="https://cloudwatchcomputing.com/" target="_blank">Open CWC Marin Flood Watch WET Dashboard &rarr;</a></p>
